bimi-no-logo-invalid = No logo shown: { $why }

bimi-senders = Senders

bimi-check-senders-when-messages-open = Check senders when messages open

bimi-check-senders-caption = Checks DKIM, SPF and DMARC and shows verified brand logos (BIMI) without asking first. The lookups reach each sender's DNS, which can tell it when you opened its mail.
